msgid "Bullets are to be thrown."
msgstr "子彈要投擲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_GNASHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_GNASHER.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the gnasher."
msgstr "沃爾特在這把彈弓上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_GNASHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_GNASHER.2"
msgid "It's a different sort of practice from mine."
msgstr "這和我平時練的不太一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA"
msgid "Bullets are to be thrown."
msgstr "子彈要投擲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the matilda fits his grip."
msgstr "我想看看瑪蒂爾達彈弓在他手裡合不合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_MATILDA.2"
msgid "I'd ask him before I changed the fittings."
msgstr "要改配件，我得先問過他。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER"
msgid "A barbaric way to reduce anything to ash."
msgstr "一種將任何東西化為灰燼的野蠻方式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER.1"
msgid "I'd set the slobber lobber beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把噴沫器放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOBBERLOBBER.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先單獨收好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE"
msgid "A smelly blob? What's the point of doing this?"
msgstr "一團有臭味的東西？我們弄這些有什麼用？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the sea sludge in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給海泥騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留給需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK"
msgid "Over time, the sludge has worn away the rock."
msgstr "隨著時間的推移，汙泥已經磨損了岩石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the thermal vent again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我們有閒暇，我想再來看看海底熱泉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGESTACK.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK"
msgid "This should speed up the processing of sludge."
msgstr "這應該可以加快處理汙泥的速度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK.1"
msgid "I'd give this muck a jar of its own."
msgstr "這種泥漿得單拿個罐子裝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_CORK.2"
msgid "I don't think that oil is ever coming off my gloves."
msgstr "手套上的油怕是洗不掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL"
msgid "ah? Sea mud oil?"
msgstr "啊？海泥油？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL.1"
msgid "I'd give this muck a jar of its own."
msgstr "這種泥漿得單拿個罐子裝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLUDGE_OIL.2"
msgid "I don't think that oil is ever coming off my gloves."
msgstr "手套上的油怕是洗不掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Dried fish makes delicious soup."
msgstr "魚乾，熬湯很好喝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the small fish jerky along without a bowl."
msgstr "帶上小魚乾就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLFISHMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜歡能塞進袖兜裡的口糧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON"
msgid "Snapdragon, but why does it make the sound of a cow?"
msgstr "金魚草，但是它為什麼會發出牛的叫聲？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.1"
msgid "Where would I find the snapdragon after dark?"
msgstr "不知道金魚草天黑以後會去哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY"
msgid "It reminds me of Venus flytraps."
msgstr "它讓我想起來了捕蠅草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY.1"
msgid "You can follow me, but do mind those jaws."
msgstr "你可以跟著我，但得當心那張嘴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPDRAGON_BUDDY.2"
msgid "A flower with an appetite. What should I feed it?"
msgstr "一朵會餓的花，我該餵它什麼呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE"
msgid "Haha, what a funny animal."
msgstr "哈哈，真是有趣的動物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE.1"
msgid "Where would I find the snapper turtle after dark?"
msgstr "不知道鱷龜天黑以後會去哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLE.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY"
msgid "Haha, what a funny animal."
msgstr "哈哈，真是有趣的動物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY.1"
msgid "Those little jaws already close quite firmly."
msgstr "小小的嘴，咬合得倒很有力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLEBABY.2"
msgid "I'll let the little turtle come out at its own pace."
msgstr "小烏龜想什麼時候探頭都行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST"
msgid "Turtle's damp nest"
msgstr "海龜的潮濕巢穴"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the nest today."
msgstr "不知道今天龜巢裡有沒有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPERTURTLENEST.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT"
msgid "hentai development."
msgstr "hentai發育。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT.1"
msgid "I'd set the snap plant beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把那株會咬人的草放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPLANT.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻過來看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST"
msgid "Does Warby want to eat this?"
msgstr "沃比想吃這個嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST.1"
msgid "I could make room for the snot roast at supper."
msgstr "晚餐還能給那份烤肉留個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOTROAST.2"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to try a bite now."
msgstr "我現在就有點想嘗一口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE"
msgid "Who wants to have a snowball fight?"
msgstr "有誰想打雪仗呀？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the snowball aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一點雪球給客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_THROWABLE.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿個乾淨盤子來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE"
msgid "There is no smell at all, just pure snow."
msgstr "什麼味道都沒有，只是單純的雪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE.1"
msgid "I'd eat it before the sun melts the edges."
msgstr "得趕在太陽曬化邊緣前吃掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWCONE.2"
msgid "A cold treat is just what I wanted."
msgstr "我正想來點冰涼的點心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES"
msgid "It keeps my head warm in a snowstorm and allows me to see the road ahead clearly."
msgstr "能讓我在暴風雪中保持頭部溫暖，還能看清前方的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES.1"
msgid "Let me try the cats-eye goggles with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我紮起頭髮試一下雪地護目鏡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWGOGGLES.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG"
msgid "Let me just say, trouble is coming."
msgstr "我就說吧，麻煩來了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG.1"
msgid "Look, the abominamole has noticed us."
msgstr "看，那隻雪獸注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMONG.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE"
msgid "I need to get rid of this pile of snow quickly, or I'll be in trouble."
msgstr "我需要趕快處理掉這堆雪，不然會有麻煩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the snow pile in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的雪堆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWPILE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人知道它的來歷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE"
msgid "My mother is going to ask me to collect clothes."
msgstr "我媽媽要叫我去收衣服了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE.1"
msgid "I wonder how far that voice carries over the water."
msgstr "不知聲音在水面上能傳多遠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_BRINE.2"
msgid "I keep listening for the next sound from it."
msgstr "我一直留心它下一次會發出什麼聲響。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED"
msgid "My mother is going to ask me to collect clothes."
msgstr "我媽媽要叫我去收衣服了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED.1"
msgid "I wonder how far that voice carries over the water."
msgstr "不知聲音在水面上能傳多遠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_RUSTED.2"
msgid "I keep listening for the next sound from it."
msgstr "我一直留心它下一次會發出什麼聲響。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER"
msgid "My mother is going to ask me to collect clothes."
msgstr "我媽媽要叫我去收衣服了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER.1"
msgid "I wonder how far that voice carries over the water."
msgstr "不知聲音在水面上能傳多遠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAKER_SPECTER.2"
msgid "I keep listening for the next sound from it."
msgstr "我一直留心它下一次會發出什麼聲響。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK"
msgid "Everything will eventually be destroyed."
msgstr "一切終將毀滅。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the abandoned shipwreck in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的那艘沉船。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPECTER_SHIPWRECK.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我該簡單畫個草圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "How disgusting!"
msgstr "好噁心啊！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它靜靜躺著，我留點距離。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR"
msgid "Sit back and wait."
msgstr "守株待兔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR.1"
msgid "I can just make out the trapdoor spider from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見活板門蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_TRAPDOOR.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "這裡的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND"
msgid "It is colonized by fungi."
msgstr "它被真菌寄生了."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND.1"
msgid "I can just make out the spore hound from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見孢子獵犬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREHOUND.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "輕一點，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK"
msgid "It's so dirty that I can't put items in it."
msgstr "好髒，不能把物品放在裡面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the spore pack."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進孢子背包。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOREPACK.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的東西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON"
msgid "Sorry, I don't drink"
msgstr "對不起，我不喝酒"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON.1"
msgid "I'll have water, if that's all right with you."
msgstr "如果可以，我喝水就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON.2"
msgid "Have you any stories to go with the drinks?"
msgstr "除了酒水，你這裡也有故事聽嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC"
msgid "There is no benefit to drinking this..."
msgstr "喝了這個沒有什麼好處……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the shadow tonic is safe."
msgstr "我得問問暗影補劑用多少才合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it away from the cooking things."
msgstr "得和做飯的東西分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY"
msgid "Elegant, but there is no benefit from drinking it..."
msgstr "優雅，但是喝了一樣沒有什麼好處……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of it is safe."
msgstr "我得問問精製暗影補劑用多少才合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STANTON_SHADOW_TONIC_FANCY.2"
msgid "I'd like to know what's in it before I try it."
msgstr "我想先弄清裡頭有什麼再用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS"
msgid "hamburger!"
msgstr "漢堡包！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS.1"
msgid "I'd bring it straight to the table."
msgstr "我把漢堡直接端上桌吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEAMEDHAMS.2"
msgid "This is worth getting a clean plate for."
msgstr "值得專門拿個乾淨盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER"
msgid "It can last a thousand years."
msgstr "它可以持續一千年。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the copper steering wheel while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平靜，我看看銅舵輪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙這邊的時候，誰來留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM"
msgid "We first need something to guide us through."
msgstr "我們首先需要一些東西來引導。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the copper steering wheel kit."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時銅舵輪套件表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_COPPER_ITEM.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙這邊的時候，誰來留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS"
msgid "Even the food is looking at me."
msgstr "連食物都在看著我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the stuffed peeper poppers after practice."
msgstr "練完以後，我想和大家分著吃釀椒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFED_PEEPER_POPPERS.2"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to try a bite now."
msgstr "我現在就有點想嘗一口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING"
msgid "tree stump? Moving? He also beats people, damn it."
msgstr "樹樁？在動？還會打人，臥槽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the pineling from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察小樹人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUMPLING.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES"
msgid "Be cool and don't talk."
msgstr "很酷，不說話。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES.1"
msgid "Would the sunglasses leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著墨鏡還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNGLASSES.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in it."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把它裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_BLUE.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的東西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in it."
msgstr "該檢查一下它裡已經裝了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_GREEN.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_ORANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_ORANGE"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_ORANGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_ORANGE.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in it."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把它裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_ORANGE.2
