msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_PURPLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_PURPLE"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_PURPLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_PURPLE.1"
