msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進海底寶箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RAINBOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RAINBOW.2"
