msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the royal sunken chest."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把海底寶箱裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RANDOM.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the gem encrusted chest."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進海底寶箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_RED.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW"
msgid "Just getting this was so painful."
msgstr "光是得到這個就太痛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in it."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把它裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST_ROYAL_YELLOW.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWILSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWILSON"
msgid "Replicas, puppets, monster figures."
msgstr "複製品，傀儡，妖怪人形。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWILSON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWILSON.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the wilson? before it moves again."
msgstr "趁那位酷似威爾遜的人沒動，我想畫下它的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWILSON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWILSON.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN"
msgid "If only we could have some movie shows to go with it."
msgstr "要是我們能有一些電影節目來配合就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN.1"
msgid "I'll save the theater corn for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "爆米花要留到能好好坐下吃飯的時候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THEATERCORN.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE"
msgid "Not a single gear in sight."
msgstr "看不到一個齒輪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE.1"
msgid "I listened twice. There's no ticking inside."
msgstr "我聽了兩遍，裡面沒有滴答聲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THE_REAL_CHARLES_T_HORSE.2"
msgid "Would you take an apple?"
msgstr "你願意吃顆蘋果嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE"
msgid "Who is coming?"
msgstr "來者何人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found it."
msgstr "我標一下發現它的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDDLESTRANGER_RNE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADLING"
msgid "Some kind of parasite?"
msgstr "某種寄生蟲？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLING.1"
msgid "I can just make out the toadling from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見小蟾蜍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLING.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪裡去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER"
msgid "Ugh, what a bad smell."
msgstr "噫，好難聞的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER.1"
msgid "I can hear the toad spore moving before I see it."
msgstr "還沒見到蟾蜍孢子就能聽到它活動的聲音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADLINGSPAWNER.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "輕一點，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR"
msgid "There must be something dangerous hidden in here, like a spider."
msgstr "這裡面肯定藏了危險的東西，比如蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the inconspicuous mound is set."
msgstr "我得記準那處土丘佈置在什麼地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOOR.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "別讓回營地的人不小心踩上來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS"
msgid "There must be danger underneath."
msgstr "那下面一定藏著危險。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the wide grass grows."
msgstr "我要記住那片草叢長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAPDOORGRASS.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根邊走，得留意腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM"
msgid "This is...a treasure? I think? Yeah? ?"
msgstr "這是……寶藏？我想？是嗎？？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM.1"
msgid "Takina would ask why I kept it."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會問我為什麼要留著它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_WATHOM.2"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when it was new."
msgstr "不知道嶄新時是什麼樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER"
msgid "amber!"
msgstr "琥珀！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER.1"
msgid "I'd like to show it to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把琥珀帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_AMBER.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一點的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES"
msgid "It's hot when you get closer"
msgstr "貼近一點都是熱的"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES.1"
msgid "I could wear the pyre mantle over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層火蕁麻披風。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ARMOR_PYRE_NETTLES.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活動得開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP"
msgid "A trap set by poachers, but it doesn't look like it's used for hunting here."
msgstr "偷獵者設置的陷阱，但是在這裡不像是用來捕獵的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the snap-trap is set."
msgstr "我得記準捕獸夾佈置在什麼地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "別讓回營地的人不小心踩上來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD"
msgid "A trap set by poachers, but it doesn't look like it's used for hunting here."
msgstr "偷獵者設置的陷阱，但是在這裡不像是用來捕獵的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the shiny snap-teeth."
msgstr "放下金齒捕獸夾時要做個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_GOLD.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "別讓回營地的人不小心踩上來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH"
msgid "A trap set by poachers, but it doesn't look like it's used for hunting here."
msgstr "偷獵者設置的陷阱，但是在這裡不像是用來捕獵的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the snap-teeth."
msgstr "放下齒夾時要做個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_EQUIPPABLE_TOOTH.2"
msgid "I'll let the others know to tread carefully here."
msgstr "我去提醒大家經過這裡要當心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD"
msgid "A trap set by poachers, but it doesn't look like it's used for hunting here."
msgstr "偷獵者設置的陷阱，但是在這裡不像是用來捕獵的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the snap-trap."
msgstr "放下舊捕獸夾時要做個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEAR_TRAP_OLD.2"
msgid "I'll let the others know to tread carefully here."
msgstr "我去提醒大家經過這裡要當心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER"
msgid "Can't deal with it head on."
msgstr "不能正面應對。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER.1"
msgid "I can hear the change in its buzzing."
msgstr "我聽得出它振翅的聲音變了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_BLOCKER.2"
msgid "I'll keep out of the bee's flight path."
msgstr "我還是別擋在蜜蜂飛過的路上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER"
msgid "Fluffy and flying!"
msgstr "蓬鬆飛起來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER.1"
msgid "I can hear the change in its buzzing."
msgstr "我聽得出它振翅的聲音變了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SEEKER.2"
msgid "I'll keep out of the bee's flight path."
msgstr "我還是別擋在蜜蜂飛過的路上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER"
msgid "Fluffy and flying!"
msgstr "蓬鬆飛起來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER.1"
msgid "I can hear the change in its buzzing."
msgstr "我聽得出它振翅的聲音變了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUARD_SHOOTER.2"
msgid "I'll keep out of the bee's flight path."
msgstr "我還是別擋在蜜蜂飛過的路上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN"
msgid "Wasp gun eh"
msgstr "胡蜂槍誒"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN.1"
msgid "Where would I find the hand held hive after dark?"
msgstr "不知道手持蜂巢天黑以後會去哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BEEGUN.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE"
msgid "ruthless. efficient."
msgstr "無情。有效。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE.1"
msgid "My grip on the pyre dart feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住火焰吹箭的感覺和握刀很不一樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BLOWDART_PYRE.2"
msgid "I can tell quite a lot from the wear on the handle."
msgstr "握柄上的磨痕能看出不少東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS"
msgid "Moss, everywhere."
msgstr "苔蘚，到處都是。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS.1"
msgid "I'll leave a marker by these leaves."
msgstr "我想在葉叢邊留個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_BRINEISHMOSS.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我湊近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "A more pure nightmare."
msgstr "更純粹的噩夢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "I don't like the pull of that shadow."
msgstr "我不喜歡那道影子給人的牽引感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_COALESCED_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "I'd like to know whose nightmare this was."
msgstr "我想知道這曾是誰的夢魘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS"
msgid "If I hadn't cooked it, what would have hatched?"
msgstr "如果我沒煮了它，那它會孵化出來什麼呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS.1"
msgid "I'd save a serving of the deviled eggs for the person who cooked."
msgstr "我想給做飯的人也留一份釀蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DEVILED_EGGS.2"
msgid "This is worth getting a clean plate for."
msgstr "值得專門拿個乾淨盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER"
msgid "What color is the electronic sheep in your dream?"
msgstr "你夢中的電子羊是什麼顏色？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER.1"
msgid "I'd set the dream catcher beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把捕夢網放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_DREAMCATCHER.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一點的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG"
msgid "Magnets are not my specialty."
msgstr "磁鐵不是我的專長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG.1"
msgid "I can feel the magnet tugging at my buckle."
msgstr "能感覺到磁鐵在拉我的帶扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANG.2"
msgid "I should keep this apart from the rest of my metal tools."
msgstr "我得把它和其餘金屬工具分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL"
msgid "It looks unstable."
msgstr "它看起來不穩定。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL.1"
msgid "I can feel the magnet tugging at my buckle."
msgstr "能感覺到磁鐵在拉我的帶扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MAGNERANGREEL.2"
msgid "I should keep this apart from the rest of my metal tools."
msgstr "我得把它和其餘金屬工具分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG"
msgid "This is? Eggs that are half a year old? wrong."
msgstr "這是？放了半年的雞蛋？不對。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG.1"
msgid "I'll keep the monster egg away from the heavy things."
msgstr "我會把怪物蛋和重東西分開。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "殼比看起來的薄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED"
msgid "Purple yolk? ? ?"
msgstr "紫色的蛋黃？？？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked monster egg."
msgstr "吃煮熟的怪物蛋我想加一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_MONSTEREGG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK"
msgid "The Watchers want us to stay here."
msgstr "監視者想讓我們一直留在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK.1"
msgid "Even on land it reminds me of the deep sea."
msgstr "即使到了岸上，它也讓我想起深海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_BEAK.2"
msgid "I would rather have seen it from the deck."
msgstr "我還是更願意站在甲板上看它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE"
msgid "don't want"
msgstr "不要"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE.1"
msgid "Even on land it reminds me of the deep sea."
msgstr "即使到了岸上，它也讓我想起深海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYE.2"
msgid "I would rather have seen it from the deck."
msgstr "我還是更願意站在甲板上看它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE"
msgid "We are not your food!"
msgstr "我們不是你的食物！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE.1"
msgid "Even on land it reminds me of the deep sea."
msgstr "即使到了岸上，它也讓我想起深海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_EYETACLE.2"
msgid "I would rather have seen it from the deck."
msgstr "我還是更願意站在甲板上看它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE"
msgid "Weapons from the sea."
msgstr "來自海洋的武器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE.1"
msgid "Even on land it reminds me of the deep sea."
msgstr "即使到了岸上，它也讓我想起深海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_OCUPUS_TENTACLE.2"
msgid "I would rather have seen it from the deck."
msgstr "我還是更願意站在甲板上看它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM"
msgid "Will it be a good decoration? possible!"
msgstr "它會是一個很好的裝飾嗎？可能！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM.1"
msgid "How about the opossum decoration on one of the lower branches?"
msgstr "把它掛在下面的枝上怎麼樣？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_OPOSSUM.2"
msgid "I'd tie the thread tight so the wind can't carry it off."
msgstr "我要把線繫牢，免得被風吹走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT"
msgid "Will it be a good decoration? possible!"
msgstr "它會是一個很好的裝飾嗎？可能！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT.1"
msgid "I'd give the rat decoration room to turn."
msgstr "得給老鼠掛飾留點轉身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_ORNAMENT_RAT.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪裡休息腳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN"
msgid "Go, go quickly, don't go near it"
msgstr "走，快走，不要靠近它"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the clockwork pawn from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察發條兵卒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Go, go quickly, don't come near it."
msgstr "走，快走，不要靠近它."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "I don't like the pull of that shadow."
msgstr "我不喜歡那道影子給人的牽引感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PAWN_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "I'd like to know whose nightmare this was."
msgstr "我想知道這曾是誰的夢魘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES"
msgid "Well, that one must be poisonous."
msgstr "好吧，那個肯定有毒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES.1"
msgid "I wonder what the pyre nettles looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，火蕁麻是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_PYRE_NETTLES.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND"
msgid "A pile of fragments of coral reefs, shells, and quartz."
msgstr "一堆珊瑚礁、貝殼、石英的碎屑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND.1"
msgid "I'd bring the sand back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把沙子帶回去仔細看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SAND.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在這裡多久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL"
msgid "Just a small pile of sand."
msgstr "一小堆沙子而已。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the sandy pile."
msgstr "得記住回到沙丘這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SANDHILL.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我該簡單畫個草圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION"
msgid "The scorpion, which is some sort of desert species, but bigger than what I saw in the book? !"
msgstr "蠍子，它是某種沙漠分類中的物種，但是比我在書中看到的還要大？！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION.1"
msgid "I can hear the scorpion moving before I see it."
msgstr "還沒見到蠍子就能聽到它活動的聲音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPION.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "輕一點，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE"
msgid "Probably a scorpion's nest."
msgstr "估計是蠍子的巢穴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the sandy hole on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下沙洞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SCORPIONHOLE.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近邊緣先看清腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE"
msgid "I could slip by if I didn't dawdle."
msgstr "如果我不磨蹭的話，我可以溜過去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE.1"
msgid "I'd label the smolder spore before I put it with the supplies."
msgstr "把冒煙的孢子收進物資前，我要先貼好標記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_SMOLDER_SPORE.2"
msgid "I'll keep it away from the cooking things."
msgstr "得和做飯的東西分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO"
msgid "The strong airflow gathered and formed this huge thing. Hurry and escape."
msgstr "強烈的氣流聚集起來，形成了這個龐然大物，趕快溜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO.1"
msgid "I'd try the giant tornado on with my hair tied back."
msgstr "試穿龍捲風之前，我想先把頭髮紮好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_TORNADO.2"
msgid "I should check where it fastens."
msgstr "我得看看它扣在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL"
msgid "When you need a pair of rain boots, where are they?"
msgstr "當你需要一雙雨鞋時，它們在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL.1"
msgid "I wonder what the waterfall looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，瀑布是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UM_WATERFALL.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN"
msgid "Is this right?"
msgstr "這才對嘛"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN.1"
msgid "I'd keep the mouthpiece clean and dry."
msgstr "吹口要保持乾淨乾燥。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_BLOWGUN.2"
msgid "This takes a steadier breath than I'd expected."
msgstr "用這個要把氣息穩得比我想的還好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON"
msgid "Stabbing from a distance has never been easier."
msgstr "遠距離刺傷從未如此簡單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON.1"
msgid "The line's as important as the harpoon out at sea."
msgstr "到了海上，繩索和魚叉一樣重要。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON.2"
msgid "I'd check it for salt and wear before we sail."
msgstr "出航前我會檢查積鹽和磨損。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL"
msgid "This is a reel deal."
msgstr "這是卷軸交易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL.1"
msgid "The line's as important as the harpoon out at sea."
msgstr "到了海上，繩索和魚叉一樣重要。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOONREEL.2"
msgid "I'd check it for salt and wear before we sail."
msgstr "出航前我會檢查積鹽和磨損。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY"
msgid "It's not as heavy as it looks."
msgstr "它沒有看起來那麼重。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY.1"
msgid "The line's as important as the harpoon out at sea."
msgstr "到了海上，繩索和魚叉一樣重要。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_HARPOON_HEAVY.2"
msgid "I'd check it for salt and wear before we sail."
msgstr "出航前我會檢查積鹽和磨損。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT"
msgid "Even if you steal things, why do you still carry a bag?"
msgstr "偷東西就算了，怎麼還帶包呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT.1"
msgid "I'll watch the pack rat without startling it."
msgstr "我儘量不驚動背東西的老鼠，看看它在做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_PACKRAT.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪裡去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT"
msgid "Good guy, bigger than the rats in southern China."
msgstr "好傢伙，比中國南方的老鼠還大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT.1"
msgid "I can hear the rat moving before I see it."
msgstr "還沒見到這隻老鼠就能聽到它活動的聲音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RAT.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪裡休息腳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW"
msgid "There is no rat poison in this shitty place, and there are no rat exterminators."
msgstr "這破地方沒有老鼠藥，也沒有除鼠專家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW.1"
msgid "These little tracks go straight beneath the ground."
msgstr "這些細小的腳印一直通到地底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATBURROW.2"
msgid "I'd keep our food well clear of this spot."
msgstr "我們的食物得離這裡遠些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD"
msgid "There is no rat poison in this shitty place, and there are no rat exterminators."
msgstr "這破地方沒有老鼠藥，也沒有除鼠專家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD.1"
msgid "These little tracks go straight beneath the ground."
msgstr "這些細小的腳印一直通到地底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_RATHERD.2"
msgid "I'd keep our food well clear of this spot."
msgstr "我們的食物得離這裡遠些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD"
msgid "It looks very sick, but it doesn't seem to matter to it."
msgstr "它看起來病得很厲害，但是好像對它來說沒影響。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD.1"
msgid "I'll watch the sickly frog without startling it."
msgstr "我儘量不驚動生病的青蛙，看看它在做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_TOAD.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "輕一點，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW"
msgid "There is no rat poison in this shitty place, and there are no rat exterminators."
msgstr "這破地方沒有老鼠藥，也沒有除鼠專家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW.1"
msgid "These little tracks go straight beneath the ground."
msgstr "這些細小的腳印一直通到地底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYBURROW.2"
msgid "I'd keep our food well clear of this spot."
msgstr "我們的食物得離這裡遠些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW"
msgid "There is no rat poison in this shitty place, and there are no rat exterminators."
msgstr "這破地方沒有老鼠藥，也沒有除鼠專家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW.1"
msgid "These little tracks go straight beneath the ground."
msgstr "這些細小的腳印一直通到地底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNCOMPROMISING_WINKYHOMEBURROW.2"
msgid "I'd keep our food well clear of this spot."
msgstr "我們的食物得離這裡遠些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT"
msgid "Step aside! I'm going to cut it in two."
msgstr "讓開！我要把它一刀兩斷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.1"
msgid "I can just make out the vampire bat from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見吸血蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪裡休息腳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE"
msgid "Skull, I'm so scared."
msgstr "頭骨，我好害怕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the melancholic skull?"
msgstr "上次站在骷髏祭壇前面的人是誰呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETERANSHRINE.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪裡放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM"
msgid "A force I don't understand, darkness?"
msgstr "我不理解的一股力量，黑暗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM.1"
msgid "I don't like the pull of that shadow."
msgstr "我不喜歡那道影子給人的牽引感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VETSITEM.2"
msgid "I'd like to know whose nightmare this was."
msgstr "我想知道這曾是誰的夢魘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT"
msgid "Looks a bit like strawberries."
msgstr "看起來有點像草莓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT.1"
msgid "Could we take the gloomberry on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著那些深色漿果吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERFRUIT.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有個盼頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM"
msgid "Can this jam be made into toast?"
msgstr "這果醬，能做吐司嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM.1"
msgid "Could we take the gloomberry jam on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著那瓶漿果醬吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERJAM.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿個乾淨盤子來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM"
msgid "There's something black flowing on it, what is it?"
msgstr "它身上流著黑黑的東西，是什麼東西？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the depths viper?"
msgstr "那條洞穴毒蛇平時也是這樣活動的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VIPERWORM.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER"
msgid "It looked like someone had camped here, but I was sure the owner was definitely not friendly."
msgstr "看起來有人在這裡扎過營，但是我能確定它的主人絕對不友好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER.1"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，海象營地是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP_SUMMER.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "從另一邊還能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN"
msgid "To be honest, I would rather cut it open and eat it."
msgstr "實不相瞞，我更想切開吃掉它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd like the watermelon lantern near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黃昏後，我想讓西瓜燈靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_LANTERN.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "憑這麼一點光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s Put your slingshot away."
msgstr "%s 把你的彈弓收起來。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先緩緩。我們談談好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下來，我聽你說。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "This is not a circus, %s?"
msgstr "這裡不是馬戲團，%s？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "%s, please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "%s，請留意火星會落到哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "%s, keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "%s，別讓火燒到大家的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC"
msgid "%s seems no different from him."
msgstr "%s 似乎和他沒什麼區別。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, good to see you. Have you eaten?"
msgstr "%s，見到你真好。吃過了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, there's room beside me at the fire."
msgstr "%s，火邊我身旁還有個位置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST"
msgid "Something bad happened to her."
msgstr "她遭遇了不幸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟緊我，我去想辦法找顆心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我們一起來的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER"
msgid "I need to hold my knife at all times."
msgstr "我需要時刻握著我的刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退後，我看見你做了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受傷了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER"
msgid "We can still cooperate, %s"
msgstr "我們還能合作，%s"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我們的朋友，我會記得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHOM.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，謝謝你在有人需要幫忙時趕了回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE"
msgid "Needless to say, that big spider must have caught a lot of creatures."
msgstr "不用想，那隻大蜘蛛肯定抓了很多生物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the silky cocoon in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的蛛絲繭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBEDCREATURE.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD"
msgid "Plant it so it can grow."
msgstr "把它種下去吧，這樣它才能生長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the whisper pod in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給這顆莢果騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在這裡多久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Having never grown this plant, I don't know exactly what it needs, but it needs seeds."
msgstr "沒種過這種植物，我不知道它具體需要什麼，但是它需要種子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll leave a marker by these leaves."
msgstr "我想在葉叢邊留個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want to see how it grows in this soil."
msgstr "我想看看它在這片土裡怎麼長。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING"
msgid "That's it, a little more..."
msgstr "就是這樣，再多一些..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING.1"
msgid "I'll leave a marker by these leaves."
msgstr "我想在葉叢邊留個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHISPERPOD_NORMAL_GROUND.GROWING.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我湊近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE"
msgid "It's going to be broken down."
msgstr "它要被分解了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the sickly tentacle."
msgstr "我標一下發現那根觸手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKER_TENTACLE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP"
msgid "The claws of that big spider can slice open those cocoons."
msgstr "那隻大蜘蛛的爪子，可以劃開那些繭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP.1"
msgid "I'd put the widow's claw within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行裝時，我會把寡婦蛛的爪放在順手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSGRASP.2"
msgid "I should make time to practice before I need it."
msgstr "趁還不急用，我該抽空練練。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD"
msgid "Ah ah ah, I don't want to wear this, take it away quickly."
msgstr "啊啊啊，我不要戴上這個，快拿走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the widow's head aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一點寡婦蛛的頭給客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIDOWSHEAD.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有個盼頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER"
msgid "I think we need to keep some distance, I don't want you to bite me."
msgstr "我覺得我們需要保持一段距離，我不希望你咬我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先緩緩。我們談談好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下來，我聽你說。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Damn it, this big rat knows how to use fire, he's really a genius."
msgstr "臥槽，這大耗子會用火，真成精了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "請留意火星會落到哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "別讓火燒到大家的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC"
msgid "Not true? ? ?"
msgstr "不是真的吧？？？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by it again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我們有閒暇，我想再來看看它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST"
msgid "Her spirit remains."
msgstr "她的靈魂依然存在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟緊我，我去想辦法找顆心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我們一起來的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer."
msgstr "謀殺者。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退後，我看見你做了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受傷了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER"
msgid "Hope you don't do anything weird."
msgstr "希望你不會做出什麼怪事。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER.1"
msgid "You took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "你救了我們的朋友，我會記得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINKY.REVIVER.2"
msgid "Thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "謝謝你在有人需要幫忙時趕了回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM"
msgid "I have learned crafts while traveling in China before, so I should be able to handle it."
msgstr "我以前在中國旅行的時候學習過手工，應該可以應付。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for it before unpacking."
msgstr "拆開薇諾娜的寶石發電機以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM"
msgid "I have learned crafts while traveling in China before, so I should be able to handle it."
msgstr "我以前在中國旅行的時候學習過手工，應該可以應付。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for it, I think."
msgstr "我看這裡放薇諾娜的發電機夠寬敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM"
msgid "I have learned crafts while traveling in China before, so I should be able to handle it."
msgstr "我以前在中國旅行的時候學習過手工，應該可以應付。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up it."
msgstr "我先給薇諾娜的投石機騰塊地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪個方向。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM"
msgid "I have learned crafts while traveling in China before, so I should be able to handle it."
msgstr "我以前在中國旅行的時候學習過手工，應該可以應付。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up it."
msgstr "我先給薇諾娜的聚光燈騰塊地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪個方向。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX"
msgid "I wonder what kind of baubles and hickeys are inside."
msgstr "我想知道裡面是什麼樣的小玩意和吻痕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the contraption container to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把工具箱帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TOOLBOX.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "讓我戴上眼鏡，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL"
msgid "Let those devices increase work efficiency."
msgstr "讓那些設備提升工作效率。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL.1"
msgid "Winona, where do these little wires connect?"
msgstr "薇諾娜，這幾根細線接在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_UPGRADEKIT_ELECTRICAL.2"
msgid "I'd like to watch you fit that to the machine."
msgstr "我想看看你怎麼把它裝到機器上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s Violence will get you nowhere,"
msgstr "%s 暴力會讓你無路可走，"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先緩緩。我們談談好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下來，我聽你說。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "How could you do this?"
msgstr "你怎麼能這樣？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "請留意火星會落到哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "別讓火燒到大家的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC"
msgid "%s seems a little unfriendly."
msgstr "%s 好像有點不太友善。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, good to see you. Have you eaten?"
msgstr "%s，見到你真好。吃過了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, there's room beside me at the fire."
msgstr "%s，火邊我身旁還有個位置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST"
msgid "Should we help %s? I'm not sure."
msgstr "我們應該幫助 %s嗎？我不太確定。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟緊我，我去想辦法找顆心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我們一起來的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Don't make me draw my sword, %s!"
msgstr "別讓我拔刀，%s！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER.1"
msgid "%s, stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "%s，退後，我看見你做了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.MURDERER.2"
msgid "%s, nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "%s，不能再有人受傷了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's motivations are a mystery."
msgstr "%s 的動機是個謎。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我們的朋友，我會記得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，謝謝你在有人需要幫忙時趕了回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN"
msgid "I learned marksmanship in Hawaii before."
msgstr "以前在夏威夷學過槍法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN.1"
msgid "I recognize the grip from target practice."
msgstr "我在打靶練習時摸過這樣的握把。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIEGUN.2"
msgid "Wixie, I'd leave that packed while we're in camp."
msgstr "薇克茜，在營地裡還是把它收好吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK"
msgid "I can't open it."
msgstr "我無法打開它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the grandfather clock to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把落地鍾帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_CLOCK.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留給需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO"
msgid "This is not the same as the piano in school..."
msgstr "這跟學校裡的鋼琴不太一樣啊...."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the grand piano to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把三角鋼琴帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_PIANO.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "讓我戴上眼鏡，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE"
msgid "Wait, how long has this been here?"
msgstr "等等，這已經在這裡多久了？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the fancy wardrobe."
msgstr "得記住回到衣櫃這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIXIE_WARDROBE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER"
msgid "I've seen them everywhere before on their migration trips!"
msgstr "我以前到處都看到他們出去遷徙旅行！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the woodpecker with its wings spread."
msgstr "我想畫下它展翅的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODPECKER.2"
msgid "I'd have to sit quite still to see it land again."
msgstr "得坐著不動，它才肯再落下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED"
msgid "It sparkles."
msgstr "它閃閃發光."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the shaped yellow gem."
msgstr "這顆磨過的寶石深處映著一點光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM_CRACKED.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it so it won't scratch against the others."
msgstr "我把它包好，免得和別的磨花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT"
msgid "Oops, I'm going to vomit"
msgstr "嘔，我要吐了"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT.1"
msgid "Oh. I'd better look at something else."
msgstr "啊，我還是看向別處吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOW_VOMIT.2"
msgid "Could we get some fresh air over here?"
msgstr "能讓這裡透透氣嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY"
msgid "My mouth feels numb after eating this blueberry."
msgstr "這個藍莓吃完嘴有點麻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY.1"
msgid "I could smell the zaspberry from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在營地另一頭就聞到了這把漿果的氣味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRY.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以嘗一口嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT"
msgid "A mouth-numbing dessert."
msgstr "吃起來嘴有點麻的甜點。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the zaspberry parfait aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一點漿果凍糕給客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ZASPBERRYPARFAIT.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DREADEYE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DREADEYE_SPOOKED"
msgid "Hey! Don't sneak up on me like that!"
msgstr "嘿！ 別這樣偷襲我！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DREADEYE_SPOOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DREADEYE_SPOOKED.1"
msgid "What was that?!"
msgstr "剛才那是什麼？！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DREADEYE_SPOOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DREADEYE_SPOOKED.2"
msgid "My heart's still racing."
msgstr "心還跳得好快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.1"
msgid "Do you remember? The person you killed?"
msgstr "你還記得嗎? 那個被你害死的人?"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.1.1"
msgid "You remember their face, don't you?"
msgstr "你還記得那張臉，對嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.1.2"
msgid "You still carry that memory."
msgstr "你至今還帶著那段記憶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.2"
msgid "They must still be looking for you anxiously, right?"
msgstr "他們一定還在著急的找你吧?"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.2.1"
msgid "Have you forgotten who's still waiting?"
msgstr "你忘了還有誰在等嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.2.2"
msgid "Someone is counting the days until you return."
msgstr "有人仍數著日子等你回來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.SHADOWTALKER.3"
msgid "she will never come back"
msgstr "她再也不會回來了"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.3.1"
msgid "If you call her name, who will answer?"
msgstr "你叫她的名字，還有誰會應聲？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.SHADOWTALKER.3.2"
msgid "Listen to how quiet it is without her."
msgstr "聽，她不在以後多安靜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.1"
msgid "No...want...come back...continue..."
msgstr "不……要……回來……繼續……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.1.1"
msgid "Not yet... call me back."
msgstr "還不行……叫我回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.1.2"
msgid "Let me return..."
msgstr "讓我回去……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.2"
msgid "The contract...has been made..."
msgstr "契約……已定……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.2.1"
msgid "The promise still binds us."
msgstr "約定仍在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.2.2"
msgid "You gave your word."
msgstr "你答應過的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSED.3"
msgid "Bring...the skull..."
msgstr "帶來……頭骨……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.3.1"
msgid "Where is the skull?"
msgstr "頭骨在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSED.3.2"
msgid "Bring what was promised."
msgstr "把約好的東西帶來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1"
msgid "Child...come...come closer..."
msgstr "小孩.....來……靠近點……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1.1"
msgid "A little nearer, child."
msgstr "孩子，再靠近一點。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.1.2"
msgid "You have heard the call."
msgstr "你已經聽見召喚了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2"
msgid "A challenge..."
msgstr "一個挑戰..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2.1"
msgid "Will you take the challenge?"
msgstr "你願意接受挑戰嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.2.2"
msgid "Name what you are willing to risk."
msgstr "說出你願意付出的代價。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3"
msgid "Curse...salvation...way out..."
msgstr "詛咒……拯救……出路……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3.1"
msgid "Would you be free of it?"
msgstr "你想擺脫它嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.VETERANCURSETAUNT.3.2"
msgid "There is a way out..."
msgstr "出路是有的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.WEBBEDCREATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.WEBBEDCREATURE"
msgid "I think I'll save it for later."
msgstr "我想是留著以後用吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.WEBBEDCREATURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.WEBBEDCREATURE.1"
msgid "There's something caught in the silk."
msgstr "蛛絲裡困著什麼東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.WEBBEDCREATURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.WEBBEDCREATURE.2"
msgid "Careful, those threads will stick to you too."
msgstr "當心，你也會被絲黏住。"
